  "body": "Skip to main content\n1 / 5\n\nSTEP\n04\nRESTORE\n,STEP 4 OF 4\n\n24h Regeneration Cream\n\nA silky day-and-night cream that seals in lasting hydration and comfort.\n\n€150\n,\n50 ml\n\nQuantity\n−\n+\nAdding…\n\n100%\npanellist-reported satisfaction\n(self-reported, 28 days)\n\nFree shipping on every order, worldwide.\nReturns within 30 days\nProvides lasting hydration and comfort\nHelps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles\nHelps protect against environmental stressors\nDETAILS\nFULL INGREDIENT LIST\nDELIVERY & RETURNS\nThe completion\n\nStep 4 of the ritual, morning and evening: the High-Tech Complex with Vitamin E, Provitamin B5 and Shea Butter, sealing in Advanced Repair Serum.\n\nA concentrated yet lightweight silky cream that melts into the skin, leaving the complexion soft, smooth and comfortable, never heavy.\n\nKey ingredients\n01\nCaviar Lipid Complex\n\nMirrors the skin's natural lipid matrix — replenishes the barrier depleted by environmental exposure and the active phases of the ritual.\n\n02\nTriple-Weight Hyaluronic Acid Complex\n\nThree molecular weights of hyaluronic acid, for hydration that feels immediate and lasts through the day.\n\n03\nSwiss Glacier Meltwater\n\nUltra-pure Swiss glacier meltwater forms the base of this cream.\n\n04\nSuperoxide Dismutase\n\nAn antioxidant enzyme that helps defend the skin against the free radicals generated by UV and pollution.\n\nFull ingredient list\n\n100%\n\n100%Panellist-reported satisfaction\n\nSELF-REPORTED\n\nMethod\nPanellist self-assessment\nPanel\n34 women aged 40–65\nUse\nTwice daily for 28 days\n\nAn independent study of 24h Regeneration Cream alone, by a contract research organisation. The figure is what panellists reported, not an instrument measurement.\n\nRead the study\n\nHow to use\n01\n\nThe final step — apply after serum and eye cream.\n\n02\n\nWarm a pea-sized amount between palms for 3 seconds.\n\n03\n\nPress gently across face and neck to seal in the steps before it.\n\n04\n\nMorning: wear under SPF. Evening: the last step before sleep.\n\nWithin the ritual\n\nEach formula prepares the skin for the next. Used together, morning and evening, they make one complete ritual.\n\n01 CLEANSE\nMicellar Water All‑in‑One Cleanser\n02 TREAT\nAdvanced Repair Serum\n03 REVIVE\nRevitalizing Eye Cream\n04 RESTORE\n24h Regeneration Cream\nThis formula\n\nThe Complete Ritual, all four formulas, €450\n\nQuestions\nCan I use it both morning and evening?\nDo I need SPF on top in the morning?\nCan I use it without the serum?\nHow long does the hydration last?\nWhat is the Caviar of Switzerland High-Tech Complex?\nWhy does this cream cost what it does?\nThe Caviar Circle\n\nRitual guidance, product news and brand updates.\n\nEmail address\nJOIN THE CAVIAR CIRCLE\nI agree to receive communications from Caviar of Switzerland. Privacy Policy.\n\nMade in Switzerland\nFree worldwide shipping\n30-day returns\nSecure checkout\nCUSTOMER CARE\nEXPLORE\nTHE HOUSE IN ZUG\n\n© 2026 Caviar of Switzerland. All rights reserved.\n\nZUG, SWITZERLAND",
